  "body_html": "<p>Did the title of my article panic you a little? Eyes widen and sweaty palms? Yea…its complete click bait. Sorry lol. </p><p>But lets have a real conversation in this StockTok Weekly Wrap up</p><p>In a normal bull market, we inch up for a few days, then have a small pull back, then begin inching up again. </p><p>But the news, politics, geo-politics and so many variables, have made this one of the most painful bull markets I have experienced in my 19 years of investing. That is why <strong>back in January, I discussed switching my strategy to trading monthly charts</strong>, instead of daily charts, and in hindsight, it has been a great decision. Not that I do not care about what is happening in Iran…but <strong>for my portfolio</strong>…I do not care what is happening in Iran. Short term investors are getting flung around like rag dolls. Up 10% one day, down -9% the next.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d8WZ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d8WZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d8WZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d8WZ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d8WZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d8WZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png\" width=\"653\" height=\"435\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:435,&quot;width&quot;:653,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:469971,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/200790682?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d8WZ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d8WZ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d8WZ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!d8WZ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa06c4e8c-a72c-4a60-93f5-277acbc00935_653x435.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>But what has happened, even with all of the volatility? A new all time high this week. An all time high last week. In fact we have made a new all time high for 7 weeks strait now. If anything, I would say a correction is pretty desperately needed. </p><p>Maybe the bull market is over…but<em><strong> I don’t think so.</strong></em> And you all know I absolutely relish the moment to make a bearish forecast lol. </p><p>One additional comment…pertaining to my monthly investment style. You will have to weather some volatility. Period. Especially with mid-cap and small cap stocks. In this article I discuss <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/bought-more-of-this-stock?r=4z8lgl\">stops and position sizing</a>. Naturally no one wants to see their entire portfolio sink -37%…hence why position sizing is important. If you ever need some help figuring out how big to go, you can either:</p><ol><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tradingview.com/v/G4JKzejz/\">Use the Position Size Calculator</a> that is easy and free for anyone to use.</p></li><li><p>Ping me in the <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/b7f4035d-fcb6-44e8-911b-6712dbc96cb7\">Main chat</a> and I am happy to help you, during market hours. </p></li></ol><p>Let me give you an example of “riding volatility” on larger timeframes. Look at the chart below for a stock we own, that is the <strong>daily </strong>timeframe. From peak, to current price, we see -15%. Yea, that sucks…if you are trading the daily timeframes, I can understand why you are concerned. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ePsB!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4f33a1a3-ea8d-4fe2-a374-9b296e94b873_1369x696.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ePsB!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4f33a1a3-ea8d-4fe2-a374-9b296e94b873_1369x696.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ePsB!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4f33a1a3-ea8d-4fe2-a374-9b296e94b873_1369x696.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ePsB!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4f33a1a3-ea8d-4fe2-a374-9b296e94b873_1369x696.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ePsB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4f33a1a3-ea8d-4fe2-a374-9b296e94b873_1369x696.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ePsB!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4f33a1a3-ea8d-4fe2-a374-9b296e94b873_1369x696.png\" width=\"1369\" height=\"696\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/4f33a1a3-ea8d-4fe2-a374-9b296e94b873_1369x696.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:696,&quot;width&quot;:1369,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:91411,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/200790682?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4f33a1a3-ea8d-4fe2-a374-9b296e94b873_1369x696.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ePsB!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fi