ucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Daily timeframe, -15% from peak to current price. Is that the bottom? Who knows. </figcaption></figure></div><p>But look at <strong>ALL </strong>of the candles…what do you see? Higher highs, higher lows, etc. Even with the drop, that trend is completely intact. Its just a crappy 3 days. Going even further, look at the monthly chart… the -15% is barely a blip on the entire chart! Looking back at 2021, imagine panicking out of a -37%, which isn’t crazy for a $9B market cap…only for it to run 2,777% right after…</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Wu33!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F389c7440-6c2a-4217-ac04-21b7af420542_1258x634.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Wu33!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F389c7440-6c2a-4217-ac04-21b7af420542_1258x634.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Wu33!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F389c7440-6c2a-4217-ac04-21b7af420542_1258x634.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Wu33!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F389c7440-6c2a-4217-ac04-21b7af420542_1258x634.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fet